<report>
<title>Paired proportions</title>

<p>Total = @{n:round2},  both = @{r:round2},  first only = @{s:round2},  second only = @{t:round2}<br />
Proportion 1 = @{prop_1:roundu}<br />
Proportion 2 = @{prop_2:roundu}<br />
Proportion difference = @{prop_diff:roundu}</p>

<block name="exact">
<p><pval>Exact two sided @{cum_2:pval}</pval><br />
<pval>Exact one sided @{cum_1:pval}</pval></p>

<p><pval>Exact two sided mid @{cum_2_mid:pval}</pval><br />
<pval>Exact one sided mid @{cum_1_mid:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
<block name="approx">
<p><warn>Numbers too large for exact test</warn><br />
Standard normal deviate z = @{z:roundu}<br />
Approximate two sided @p_2<br />
Approximate one sided @p_1</p>
</block>

<p><ci>@qcl @{pc:round2}% confidence interval for the proportion difference:</ci><br />
<ci>@{lower:roundu} to @{upper:roundu}</ci></p>
</report>
